<title>USA: Banco Latinoamericano Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Banco Latinoamericano Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.03		    $0.98</p>
<p> Net		 21,186		   20,381</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  20,223		   20,346</p>
<p>Nine months Sept. 30</p>
<p> Shr		 $2.92		    $2.52</p>
<p> Net		 60,206		   52,316</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  20,285		   20,331</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The third quarter includes non-recurring income of $2.1 millino related to recoveries from Banco Latino, NV, which were used to increase loan loss reserves.</p>
<p>The bank reported net interest income of $23.88 million for the third quarter, compared to $23.94 million for the year-ago figure.</p>
</text>
